From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.ui.xaml: ListView from the keyboard; FocusManager

A ListView's items now take the keyboard focus: the list is one Tab stop (coming back, the item focused before, else its selected item, else its first), Up, Down, Home, End, Page Up and Page Down move the focus through its items with the selection following in Single and Extended mode, Space selects the focused item and Enter raises ItemClick for it. A click on an item focuses it. Items written as content in markup (<ListView><x:String>One</x:String>...) now go into Items. FocusManager is there: GetFocusedElement and TryMoveFocus (Next, Previous and the four directions). Behind the XAML switch of 6131.
---
